{"route":"/docs/5.1/layout/z-index/","version":"5.1","renderedVersion":"5.1","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Z-index","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"While not a part of Bootstrap’s grid system, z-indexes play an important part in how our components overlay and interact with one another."},"blocks":[{"id":"content--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Several Bootstrap components utilize <code>z-index</code>, the CSS property that helps control layout by providing a third axis to arrange content. We utilize a default z-index scale in Bootstrap that’s been designed to properly layer navigation, tooltips and popovers, modals, and more."},{"id":"content--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"These higher values start at an arbitrary number, high and specific enough to ideally avoid conflicts. We need a standard set of these across our layered components—tooltips, popovers, navbars, dropdowns, modals—so we can be reasonably consistent in the behaviors. There’s no reason we couldn’t have used <code>100</code>+ or <code>500</code>+."},{"id":"content--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"We don’t encourage customization of these individual values; should you change one, you likely need to change them all."},{"id":"content--code-1","type":"code","value":"$zindex-dropdown:                   1000;\n$zindex-sticky:                     1020;\n$zindex-fixed:                      1030;\n$zindex-offcanvas-backdrop:         1040;\n$zindex-offcanvas:                  1045;\n$zindex-modal-backdrop:             1050;\n$zindex-modal:                      1055;\n$zindex-popover:                    1070;\n$zindex-tooltip:                    1080;","language":"scss"},{"id":"content--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"To handle overlapping borders within components (e.g., buttons and inputs in input groups), we use low single digit <code>z-index</code> values of <code>1</code>, <code>2</code>, and <code>3</code> for default, hover, and active states. On hover/focus/active, we bring a particular element to the forefront with a higher <code>z-index</code> value to show their border over the sibling elements."}],"demos":[],"nav":[{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/download/"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/contents/"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/browsers-devices/"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/javascript/"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/webpack/"},{"en":"Parcel","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/parcel/"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/accessibility/"},{"en":"RFS","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/rfs/"},{"en":"RTL","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/rtl/"},{"en":"Contribute","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/contribute/"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/customize/overview/"},{"en":"Sass","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/customize/sass/"},{"en":"Options","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/customize/options/"},{"en":"Color","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/customize/color/"},{"en":"Components","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/customize/components/"},{"en":"CSS variables","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/customize/css-variables/"},{"en":"Optimize","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/customize/optimize/"},{"en":"Breakpoints","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/layout/breakpoints/"},{"en":"Containers","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/layout/containers/"},{"en":"Grid","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/layout/grid/"},{"en":"Columns","href":